{title: All God's People Rejoice}
{artist: Larry Holder / Elton Smith}
{time: 4/4}
{key: A}
{tempo: 152}

>Lyrics

(Short introduction)

All God's people rejoice,

Lift high His holy Name!

Raise your voice to the sky,

Let all God's children proclaim:

Je-sus is the LORD!

Jesus Christ is LORD of Lords!

All God's people rejoice,

Lift high His holy Name!

Raise your voice to the sky,

Let all God's children proclaim:

Je-sus is the LORD!

Jesus Christ is LORD of Lords!

Every knee shall bow

And tongue confess,

To Him ascribe

All righteousness.

Every knee shall bow

And tongue confess

That He

Is the King

He's the LORD!

All God's people rejoice,

Lift high His holy Name!

Raise your voice to the sky,

Let all God's children proclaim:

Je-sus is the LORD!

Jesus Christ is LORD of Lords!

Every knee shall bow

And tongue confess,

To Him ascribe

All righteousness.

Every knee shall bow

And tongue confess

That He

Is the King.

Every knee shall bow

And tongue confess,

To Him ascribe

All righteousness.

Every knee shall bow

And tongue confess

That He

Is the King

He's the LORD!
